  "id": "precompetition-anxiety",
  "term": "precompetition anxiety",
  "definition": "Precompetition anxiety is the form of competitive state anxiety that occurs before a sports competition. It refers to a temporary anxiety state linked to upcoming performance and is commonly understood in terms of bodily symptoms, worried thoughts, and changes in self-confidence.",
